.assetsignore
# Inverse of .assetsignore.static: upload only v1/images. Whitelisting a nested
# dir needs the dir re-included at every level before its contents.
/*
!/v1/
/v1/*
!/v1/images/
# Local completion marker only — the payload ships inside variant EXIF (or
# sidecar.json.gz for bundles that can't embed). One file slot per image adds up.
metadata.json.gz
